{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/628025-changelings-that-are-descended-from-chimera-implications","id":628025,"title":"Changelings that are descended from Chimera: Implications?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-15T15:21:01-07:00","id":628025,"title":"Changelings that are descended from Chimera: Implications?","content":"So in Dreams and Nightmares (pg 111) it states that some Changelings are descended from dragon chimera. What do you suppose this implies about the Changelings and their Kiths? The Kiths all seem to follow certain guidelines in appearance, were they reshaped? Could ordinary chimera have tried to rebuild themselves from stray dreams and into an Archetype that humans are familiar with and the True Fae and their Kiths are the results?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-15T15:52:11-07:00","id":628085,"title":"","content":"It may have been a throwaway line at the time (or perhaps not . . .), but the sidhe (at least) have gone through one (and maybe more) major revision(s) by humanity. Apparently, when they were first dreamt, the sidhe were just champions &amp; villains, albeit very beautiful ones. It was only generations later, when humans themselves embraced monarchial systems, that dreamers recast them as royalty, aristocrats, and knights, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-16T21:24:36-07:00","id":629543,"title":"","content":"I think it simply means that the bloodlines &quot;infused&quot; by Dragons had an innate connection to the dreaming which made them prime opportunities or Changelings to find lovers or otherwise take as family. it's not that there are changeling kiths derived from dragons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/612-the-cat-came-back","name":"The Cat Came Back","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar612_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-16T22:52:46-07:00","id":629579,"title":"","content":"Actually, it was very clear that it meant directly descended from a dragon's mating with someone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-18T07:16:41-07:00","id":631150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/628025-changelings-that-are-descended-from-chimera-implications?p=629579#post629579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, it was very clear that it meant directly descended from a dragon's mating with someone.</div> </div> </div> </div>It says 'many fae can claim descent from these dragons'. Fae doesn't specifically mean changelings, but rather any beings of the Dreaming. It could, for instance, refer to other chimerae, or even adhene and gallain.<br /> <br /> If you do want to create dragon kithain, however, there's nothing stopping you. Describe the fae mien. Give them an Affinity Realm (Nature?). Allow the character to take any two of the following as Birthrights: 1-3 point Merits (probably Winged and something to do with fire-breathing or noxious breath, or else something to do with huge size and natural armour), 1-3 point Special Advantages or 1-3 point Redes (the rule for any Merit trumps alternatives if there's a conflict). Then give them a corresponding 3-point Flaw as a Frailty (e.g., an obsession, or greed, or a requirement to sleep on a base metal, or in a particular element?). Hey presto!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}